sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor User as Facility Manager / Analyst
    participant React as React TypeScript Web UI
    participant API as FastAPI Backend Service
    participant ML as ML Inference Engine
    participant GCS as Google Cloud Storage
    participant CloudFunc as Cloud Run Function ETL
    participant BQ as BigQuery Warehouse
    participant Vertex as Vertex AI Model Registry

    Note over User, React: User uploads CSV telemetry or views dashboard
    User->>React: Browse to Dashboard / Demand Forecast
    React->>API: GET /api/dashboard/summary
    API-->>React: Aggregated KPIs, Trends, Anomaly Counts

    User->>React: Request 7-Day Forecast for Hostel Block A
    React->>API: POST /api/forecast {meter_id: "MTR-HOSTEL-A", horizon: 168}
    API->>ML: Predict with Random Forest & Confidence Bounds
    ML-->>API: 168 Hourly Predictions (Confidence Bounds & Metrics)
    API-->>React: Forecast Response with MAE & R²

    Note over User, GCS: Raw Telemetry Batch Ingestion
    User->>React: Upload Telemetry CSV Batch
    React->>API: POST /api/datasets/upload
    API->>GCS: Upload to gs://aquasense-ai-raw-telemetry
    GCS-->>CloudFunc: Trigger google.storage.object.finalize
    CloudFunc->>CloudFunc: Clean, Validate Schema, Deduplicate
    CloudFunc->>BQ: Idempotent MERGE into water_consumption_hourly
    BQ-->>CloudFunc: Merge Success
    CloudFunc-->>GCS: Log Audit Lineage Complete

    Note over BQ, Vertex: Periodic Retraining Pipeline
    BQ->>Vertex: Extract Partitioned Training Dataset
    Vertex->>Vertex: Time-Aware Split (Chronological 80/20)
    Vertex->>Vertex: Train Baseline Linear Regression vs Random Forest
    Vertex->>Vertex: Compute MAE, RMSE, R² & Anomaly Confusion Matrix
    Vertex->>API: Update Active Model Artifacts & Metadata
